{"seq":1,"slug":"vector-pattern-library-reduction-scan-dot","title":"核心向量化模式库：归约、前缀扫描、点积与稀疏处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpu-simd-vectorization-avx-neon-intrinsics-engineering/patterns-debug-perf-ops/vector-pattern-library-reduction-scan-dot","wordCount":2590,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"核心向量化模式库-归约-前缀扫描-点积与稀疏处理\">核心向量化模式库：归约、前缀扫描、点积与稀疏处理</h1><p>SIMD intrinsics 只是散件：<code>_mm256_add_ps</code> 加八个 float，<code>_mm256_permutevar8x32_ps</code> 换一下 lane 顺序。真正决定向量代码快慢的，是把散件拼成的几种<strong>固定骨架</strong>。本文讲透复用率最高的六种：归约、前缀扫描、点积、窄整型点积、稀疏掩码压缩、跨块两遍扫描。ISA 家族能力见 <a href=\"../simd-hardware-vector-model/isa-portfolio-avx2-avx512-neon-sve\">ISA 家族谱系</a>，寄存器模型见 <a href=\"../intrinsics-data-movement/intrinsics-type-register-model\">intrinsics 类型与寄存器模型</a>，掩码与尾部见 <a href=\"../intrinsics-data-movement/mask-tail-alignment-memory-safety\">掩码、尾部、对齐与内存安全</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把串行数学映射成-lane-并行\">核心概念：把串行数学映射成 lane 并行</h2><p>这些骨架都在做同一件事：<strong>把数学定义里的串行依赖重组成 lane 内并行 + 跨 lane 收尾</strong>。<strong>依赖方向</strong>决定复杂度：归约与点积是「全量汇聚到一值」，各 lane 互不依赖，收尾才跨 lane 通信，最廉价；前缀扫描是「第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个输出依赖前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个」，依赖成链，必须拆成 lane 内 + carry 两段；稀疏处理是「输出位置由数据决定」，只能先把控制流数据化。<strong>跨 lane 通信代价</strong>决定布局：横向操作（水平归约、lane 偏移、广播）都要走 <code>shuffle</code>/<code>permute</code>/<code>ext</code>，判据是<strong>横向操作越少越好、越靠后越好</strong>——垂直累加把横向操作压到循环外一次收尾，这正是它快的全部原因。<strong>确定性</strong>决定取舍：改变结合顺序就改变浮点低位比特，先想清楚哪类输出需要逐位可复现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归约-水平归约是例外-垂直累加才是常态\">归约：水平归约是例外，垂直累加才是常态</h2><p>求数组和，直觉写法是向量加总后再做一次水平归约 <code>_mm256_hadd_ps</code>——这是最常见的性能陷阱：<code>hadd</code> 被官方指令表标注为多 µop 且端口受限（Agner Fog 指令表，<a href=\"https://www.agner.org/optimize/\">https://www.agner.org/optimize/</a>）。正确骨架是<strong>垂直（vertical）归约</strong>：维护向量累加器，每轮把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 路数据各归各的 lane，循环结束后只做一次水平收尾。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个元素做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 路累加，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil n/V \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 次向量加串成依赖链。若加法延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、吞吐 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，单累加器耗时约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil n/V \\rceil \\cdot L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，4 路展开降到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil n/V \\rceil \\cdot T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 通常 3–4）。这就是「多累加器」骨架——<strong>用寄存器换依赖链</strong>，AVX-512 有 32 个 zmm。水平收尾有平台差异：AVX2 用 <code>extractf128</code>+<code>add</code>+<code>shufps</code> 两级比 <code>hadd</code> 快；AVX-512 用 <code>_mm512_reduce_add_ps</code>（编译器内建序列）；AArch64 用 <code>vaddvq_f32</code>（真正的水平加）；SVE 用带谓词的 <code>svaddv_f32</code>，天然处理非满向量。</p>\n<p><strong>确定性是第二条约束。</strong> IEEE-754 加法不满足结合律，向量归约改变结合顺序，低位比特必然与标量串行求和不同：同一输入两次运行须逐位一致，换机器与标量参考值可能差最后一位；要求跨平台逐位可复现时只能牺牲宽度或用 Kahan 补偿。NumPy 文档说明 <code>np.sum</code> 对浮点用<strong>成对求和（pairwise summation）</strong>（<a href=\"https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/generated/numpy.sum.html\">https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/generated/numpy.sum.html</a>），误差界与向量归约的树形结构同阶：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mtext>err</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ε</mi><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left|\\text{err}\\right| \\le \\left\\lceil \\log_2 n \\right\\rceil \\cdot \\varepsilon \\sum_{i}\\left|x_i\\right|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">err</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">⌉</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这解释了为何向量归约<strong>往往比串行更准</strong>：长依赖链换成浅加法树。前提是分段累加不退化成长链——单累加器处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个元素时误差以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n/V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 步线性积累，此时应做<strong>分段归约</strong>（每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 收一次），也是 oneDNN、LAPACK <code>ddot</code> 的做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前缀扫描-hillis-steele-与-blelloch-的工程取舍\">前缀扫描：Hillis-Steele 与 Blelloch 的工程取舍</h2><p>前缀和（prefix sum / scan）比归约难，因为它无法只靠垂直累加完成——第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个输出依赖前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个，天然串行。全部技巧在于<strong>把串行依赖分解成 lane 内并行 + 跨 lane 偏移</strong>。两个经典算法正好相反：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>步骤数</th>\n<th>总工作量</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Hillis-Steele（1986, CACM）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil \\log_2 n \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 步</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>寄存器内小规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blelloch（1990, CMU-CS-90-190）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\lceil \\log_2 n \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 步</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>大数组、块级、GPU</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Hillis-Steele 每步把向量整体偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个元素再相加，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 步走完一个向量内的全部前缀：8 路 AVX2 是 3 步，AVX-512 的 16 路是 4 步。SIMD 没有「向右移 lane」的直接指令：x86 用 <code>_mm256_permutevar8x32_ps</code> 配索引常量表，AArch64 用 <code>vextq_f32</code>。骨架如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[输入 8 lane&lt;br/&gt;v = a0..a7] --&gt; B[步1: 偏移 1&lt;br/&gt;v += shift1 v]&#10;    B --&gt; C[步2: 偏移 2&lt;br/&gt;v += shift2 v]&#10;    C --&gt; D[步3: 偏移 4&lt;br/&gt;v += shift4 v]&#10;    D --&gt; E[寄存器内前缀和&lt;br/&gt;取 lane7 作块和 carry]&#10;    E --&gt; F[下一块整体加 carry&lt;br/&gt;broadcast 加法]&#10;    F --&gt; G[块间串行 or&lt;br/&gt;递归两遍扫描]\">graph TD\n    A[输入 8 lane&lt;br/&gt;v = a0..a7] --&gt; B[步1: 偏移 1&lt;br/&gt;v += shift1 v]\n    B --&gt; C[步2: 偏移 2&lt;br/&gt;v += shift2 v]\n    C --&gt; D[步3: 偏移 4&lt;br/&gt;v += shift4 v]\n    D --&gt; E[寄存器内前缀和&lt;br/&gt;取 lane7 作块和 carry]\n    E --&gt; F[下一块整体加 carry&lt;br/&gt;broadcast 加法]\n    F --&gt; G[块间串行 or&lt;br/&gt;递归两遍扫描]</pre><p><strong>块间依赖才是真正瓶颈。</strong> 寄存器内扫描只解决一个向量内部；向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 的每个 lane 还要加前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个向量的总和。把块和 <code>lane7</code> 广播回下一块就形成<strong>跨块串行依赖链</strong>，长度等于块数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil n/V \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span>，对大数组会吞掉向量化全部收益。解法是两遍法（two-pass / chained scan）：第一遍只算<strong>每块的和</strong>（纯归约，完全并行），对块和数组做一次小规模 scan，第二遍把每块 carry 广播加回。Blelloch 的 up-sweep/down-sweep 正是此概念在树上的形式化，工作量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、串行深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，也是 GPU CUB、thrust 里 <code>DeviceScan</code> 的基线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"点积-fma-掩码尾部与累加器数量\">点积：FMA、掩码尾部与累加器数量</h2><p>点积（dot product）是归约的乘积形式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i a_i b_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，向量化时天然映射到<strong>乘法 + 归约累加器</strong>，有 FMA 的平台上乘加融合成一条指令：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>dot</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>acc</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>fma</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>vec</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>vec</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>acc</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dot}(a,b)=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1} a_i b_i \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\text{acc} \\mathrel{+}= \\text{fma}(a_{\\text{vec}}, b_{\\text{vec}}, \\text{acc})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dot</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0788em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fma</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vec</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vec</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>_mm256_fmadd_ps</code> / <code>vfmaq_f32</code> 把乘、加合并为单条指令且<strong>中间乘积不舍入</strong>——既是性能优势，也是精度优势（少一次舍入）；代价是舍入行为与「先乘后加」不同。三个关键决策：<strong>累加器数量</strong>（依赖链由加法延迟主导，4 路展开把瓶颈从延迟转到吞吐）；<strong>尾部处理</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 整数倍时，AVX2 需标量尾巴，AVX-512 用 <code>_mm512_maskz_loadu_ps</code> 一条吃掉，SVE 用谓词 <code>whilelt</code> 天然处理任意长度）；<strong>归约方式</strong>（与归约一节相同，别用 <code>hadd</code>）。</p>\n<p><strong>窄整型点积是另一个物种。</strong> 量化推理、向量检索、图像处理的点积通常跑在 int8 上，目标变成<strong>在一条指令里做更多次乘加</strong>：x86 的 <code>_mm256_maddubs_epi16</code> 把无符号 8 位乘有符号 8 位、两两相加成 16 位；AVX-512 VNNI 的 <code>_mm512_dpbusd_epi32</code> 直接把 4 组 int8 乘积累加进一个 int32（Intel Intrinsics Guide：<a href=\"https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/docs/intrinsics-guide/index.html\">https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/docs/intrinsics-guide/index.html</a>）。这使 int8 点积<strong>每周期运算次数是 float32 的 4 倍</strong>，也是量化推理快的根源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据型别</th>\n<th>x86 关键指令</th>\n<th>每指令乘加数</th>\n<th>累加器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>float32</td>\n<td><code>_mm256_fmadd_ps</code></td>\n<td>8（AVX2）/ 16（AVX-512）</td>\n<td>float32</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bfloat16</td>\n<td><code>_mm512_dpbf16_ps</code>（AVX512_BF16）</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>float32</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>int8</td>\n<td><code>_mm512_dpbusd_epi32</code>（AVX512_VNNI）</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>int32</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>int8 (NEON)</td>\n<td><code>vdotq_s32</code></td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>int32</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"稀疏与掩码-把分支换成压缩-扩展\">稀疏与掩码：把分支换成压缩/扩展</h2><p>「只处理满足条件的元素」在标量代码里是 <code>if</code>，在向量代码里是<strong>掩码选择</strong>与<strong>压缩</strong>，三层骨架按平台能力递增：**选择（blend）**用 <code>_mm256_blendv_ps</code> 或掩码 <code>_mm512_mask_add_ps</code>，保留 lane 位置、不写无用值；**压缩（compress）**用 AVX-512 VBMI2 的 <code>_mm512_maskz_compress_epi32</code> 把满足谓词的 lane 打包到向量低端，配合 <code>_mm_mask_compressstoreu_ps</code> <strong>紧凑写回</strong>内存，输出长度由掩码 <code>popcount</code> 给出，是 SIMD 版「原地删除」的最优形态，SVE 用 <code>svcompact</code>；<strong>收集/散开</strong>用 <code>_mm512_i32gather_ps</code> 按索引取数，但 gather 在多数 x86 微架构上是微码多 µop，吞吐远低于连续加载，<strong>只有索引基本连续时才有收益</strong>，NEON 无 gather 需手动 <code>vld1</code> 集合。</p>\n<p>一个可复用骨架是「结构索引 + 批量处理」，也是 simdjson 的核心手法：先用向量比较生成位掩码，再用 <code>popcount</code>/<code>ctz</code> 逐位驱动后续处理，而非逐元素分支（Langdale &amp; Lemire, VLDB Journal 2019, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.08318\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.08318</a>），价值是把<strong>控制依赖转成数据依赖</strong>。另一常被忽视的事实是<strong>过滤后输出长度不规则</strong>，会打断后续对齐假设，工程上把稀疏与稠密阶段<strong>分块隔离</strong>：稀疏过滤产生紧凑数组，稠密计算再在紧凑数组上跑满向量。compress 与布局变换详见 <a href=\"../intrinsics-data-movement/load-store-shuffle-layout-transform\">加载、存储、置换与布局变换</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能运维-这三种骨架的-roofline-位置\">性能运维：这三种骨架的 roofline 位置</h2><p>同一骨架在不同算术强度下命运完全不同，写完后必须知道自己在 roofline 哪一侧（Williams et al., <em>Roofline</em>, CACM 2009）。归约与点积是典型<strong>内存带宽受限</strong>：每读一个 float 只做一两次浮点运算，算术强度低于 1 flop/byte，上界由带宽而非 FLOPS 决定。前缀扫描更糟：写回量等于读入量再加一次 carry，块间依赖链还暴露延迟。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>骨架</th>\n<th>算术强度（概量）</th>\n<th>瓶颈</th>\n<th>首要优化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>归约</td>\n<td>~1 flop/byte</td>\n<td>内存带宽</td>\n<td>多累加器消除加法延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点积 (fp32)</td>\n<td>~2 flop/byte</td>\n<td>带宽 + FMA 吞吐</td>\n<td>4 路展开；分块提升 cache 命中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点积 (int8)</td>\n<td>~8+ op/byte</td>\n<td>计算（VNNI 吞吐）</td>\n<td>用 VNNI；避免 16 位中间结果溢出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前缀扫描</td>\n<td>&lt;1 flop/byte</td>\n<td>跨块依赖链</td>\n<td>两遍法；块和 scan 用 Hillis-Steele</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稀疏过滤</td>\n<td>取决于稀疏度</td>\n<td>分支/gather 延迟</td>\n<td>掩码压缩替代分支</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>验证纪律要固定。用 <code>perf stat</code> 观察 <code>cycles</code>、<code>instructions</code>、<code>fp_arith_inst_retired.*</code>——本应带宽受限的归约若跑出高 IPC 而 <code>fp_arith_inst_retired</code> 很低，说明向量化没生效。反汇编确认热循环出现 <code>vaddps</code>/<code>vfmadd213ps</code> 而非 <code>addss</code>。用编译器报告交叉验证：GCC <code>-fopt-info-vec-optimized</code>、Clang <code>-Rpass=loop-vectorize</code>、MSVC <code>/Qvec-report:2</code>；某段扫描为何没被自动向量化，诊断路径见 <a href=\"../compiler-autovectorization-portability/autovectorization-legality-diagnosis\">自动向量化的合法性判定与诊断</a>。</p>\n<p>最后一条纪律与骨架同等重要：<strong>先测带宽上界，再谈指令优化</strong>。对内存受限的归约，把 <code>add</code> 换成耗时更短的 <code>add</code> 不会更快；只有实测吞吐低于 <code>带宽 × 数据规模</code> 给出的上界时，才是微架构级优化（多累加器、展开、非临时加载）的时机（Highway 快速参考：<a href=\"https://google.github.io/highway/en/master/quick_reference.html\">https://google.github.io/highway/en/master/quick_reference.html</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>归约</strong>用垂直累加器而非 <code>hadd</code>；2–8 个累加器打断加法延迟链；分段收尾防止误差线性积累，误差界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)\\cdot\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 优于串行。</li>\n<li><strong>前缀扫描</strong>用寄存器内 Hillis-Steele 解决 lane 内，用两遍法消除跨块 carry 链；Blelloch 适合大数组与块级。</li>\n<li><strong>点积</strong>是「乘 + 归约」，有 FMA 就用 <code>fmadd</code>；窄整型用 VNNI/<code>sdot</code>/<code>svdot</code> 把每指令乘加数提到 4 倍。</li>\n<li><strong>稀疏</strong>用掩码选择、compress、gather 三层替代分支；gather 只在索引连续时划算；稀疏与稠密分块隔离。</li>\n<li><strong>运维</strong>先测 roofline 位置（带宽 vs 计算），再看反汇编与向量化报告，把「逐位一致」写进测试。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些骨架是 <a href=\"../simd-hardware-vector-model/isa-portfolio-avx2-avx512-neon-sve\">ISA 家族谱系</a> 的第一类消费者：同一骨架在 AVX2、AVX-512、NEON、SVE 上的差异几乎全集中在横向操作与掩码处理指令。把骨架与 ISA 解耦，就是分派层能只换指令、不换算法的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"核心向量化模式库：归约、前缀扫描、点积与稀疏处理","id":"核心向量化模式库-归约-前缀扫描-点积与稀疏处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把串行数学映射成 lane 并行","id":"核心概念-把串行数学映射成-lane-并行"},{"level":2,"text":"归约：水平归约是例外，垂直累加才是常态","id":"归约-水平归约是例外-垂直累加才是常态"},{"level":2,"text":"前缀扫描：Hillis-Steele 与 Blelloch 的工程取舍","id":"前缀扫描-hillis-steele-与-blelloch-的工程取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"点积：FMA、掩码尾部与累加器数量","id":"点积-fma-掩码尾部与累加器数量"},{"level":2,"text":"稀疏与掩码：把分支换成压缩/扩展","id":"稀疏与掩码-把分支换成压缩-扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"性能运维：这三种骨架的 roofline 位置","id":"性能运维-这三种骨架的-roofline-位置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"编译器提示与构建实践：pragma、restrict、-march 与数值可复现性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpu-simd-vectorization-avx-neon-intrinsics-engineering/compiler-autovectorization-portability/compiler-hints-flags-numerical-reproducibility"},"next":{"title":"正确性与调试：标量-向量差分测试、越界检测与特殊值语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpu-simd-vectorization-avx-neon-intrinsics-engineering/patterns-debug-perf-ops/correctness-differential-debug-special-values"}}